# Container images (ADR-0109). The list was rebuilt on 2026-11-24 from a scan of the images' SBOMs without
# this file: 63 HIGH/CRITICAL ids in the API image, 6 in the web image. All but the one below came from
# things the images no longer carry: pnpm and npm with their bundled dependencies, the test runner (vitest,
# vite, tinypool), the compilers (the TypeScript Go port, vite's esbuild). A new entry needs its reason here.

# deepmerge-ts 7.1.5 inside the Prisma CLI (apps/api > prisma > @prisma/config). It merges the project's own
# prisma.config, never request data; the fix is a major inside Prisma 6.19. Same exception, same expiry
# (2027-02-28), as in scripts/checks/dependency-audit.mjs. Goes with the next Prisma upgrade.
